<title>DUBAI: Sharjah air volumes up 19 pct in Oct on year ago.</title>
<headline>Sharjah air volumes up 19 pct in Oct on year ago.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharjah airport said cargo volumes rose 19 percent in October to 30,261 tonnes from 25,487 tonnes in the same month in 1995.</p>
<p>This compared to the near 26,725 tonnes handled in September 1996.</p>
<p>Sea-air freight exports rose two percent in the month to 2,402 tonnes from 2,353 tonnes the previous October.</p>
<p>Mail volume rose 24 percent to 2.39 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom, +9714-626990</p>
</text>
